ストの用途---\n・SNSの投稿やグッズ(ステッカ\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/194HCyIu2lFgTWAo8qeUBoFKd6JVPtqlU?usp=drive_link", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@9302w/works/333", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1652641, "client_id": 98323, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2d7e980a/uploads/origins/d31547c7-c5c9-4c02-8921-e60bffc70068?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fd2a0c3484f5e0698099de07729303ef", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2d7e980a/uploads/origins/d31547c7-c5c9-4c02-8921-e60bffc70068?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8f639b4faa116904ca4ea8c7d2df8db6", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！https://i.imgur.com/8BoQlX7.png。\nかわいいポーズで\nよろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://catbox.moe/c/0dwwz7", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@9302w/works/332", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1652641, "client_id": 2321048, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d73fec24/uploads/origins/e23aa61c-b91e-440e-899c-69277b05981a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2f01971689593171838f8f8a9b0ff7fb", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d73fec24/uploads/origins/e23aa61c-b91e-440e-899c-69277b05981a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=cb07e50fde4624fa0a42ba4249d04212", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！あなたの絵が大好きです。\n僕のキャラクター、ソナの絵をお願いしたいんだ。詳細についてはお任せします。私の絵と他の人の絵、服のアイデアをいくつか載せました。\nリクエストに答えてくれてありがとう！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/11OjRtYyGngNvb8TndHZ3KivWcuxj1p-c/view?usp=sharing", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@9302w/works/331", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1652641, "client_id": 2069976, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9bb35a6b/uploads/origins/cf00c5b0-99bb-4692-a10f-143d9718ef9e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=df441e82c1e801937f1d52f66ee77aa7", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9bb35a6b/uploads/origins/cf00c5b0-99bb-4692-a10f-143d9718ef9e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=27355efff2454d2d0a50fba9eaec8cb4", "src_set": ""}, "body": "シケもくさんこんばんは！今回は東方Projectのナズーリンを描いて頂きたく依頼させていただきました！\n\n東方の最新にピラミッドが出てきて、ピラミッドといえば宝探し、宝探しといえばナズーリン（だと勝手に思ってる）なので、探検家の服を着て\nナズーリンロッド（ダウンジング棒）を持ってレア物を手に入れようと意気揚々にきょろきょろしてる感じでお願いしたいです！\n\nあと某SNSに載せさせていただきたいです！ご検討お願いします！", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@9302w/works/330", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1652641, "client_id": 1611227, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4d49b112/uploads/origins/1a0edde3-2f8e-416d-a595-d9480297cd12?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bb4c8c17dd786ec1f8b87edd14a7b442", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4d49b112/uploads/origins/1a0edde3-2f8e-416d-a595-d9480297cd12?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9532ca9e6be48cd590ce7476f429fcfc", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！最近あなたの絵を見つけました！\nこのキャラクター、軍国魔法少女ジュンコの作品をお願いしたいです